 ry of a psychopathic preacher who pursues two children who hold the key to
  hidden loot. 70th anniversary screening.  Introduced by SIFF Education 
 Manager Megan Garbayo-López.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events
 /siff-movie-club/the-night-of-the-hunter\n\nEstimated start: 2:15
